{"id":"torrey:jordan-the-river","source":"torrey","name":"Jordan, The River","slug":"jordan-the-river","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Eastern boundary of Canaan — Nu 34:12.","refs":[["Num",34,12,34,12]]},{"text":"Often overflowed — Jos 3:15; 1Ch 12:15.","refs":[["Josh",3,15,3,15],["1Chr",12,15,12,15]]},{"text":"Overflowing of, called the swelling of Jordan — Jer 12:5; 49:19.","refs":[["Jer",12,5,12,5],["Jer",49,19,49,19]]},{"text":"Empties itself into the Dead Sea — Nu 34:12.","refs":[["Num",34,12,34,12]]},{"text":"Thickly wooded. — 2Ki 6:2.","refs":[["2Kgs",6,2,6,2]]},{"text":"Exceeding fertile. — Ge 13:10.","refs":[["Gen",13,10,13,10]]},{"text":"Infested with lions. — Jer 49:19; 50:44.","refs":[["Jer",49,19,49,19],["Jer",50,44,50,44]]},{"text":"Afforded clay for moulding brass, & c. — 1Ki 7:46; 2Ch 4:17.","refs":[["1Kgs",7,46,7,46],["2Chr",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"Chosen by Lot for a residence. — Ge 13:11.","refs":[["Gen",13,11,13,11]]},{"text":"Fordable in some places — Jos 2:7; Jdj 12:5,6.","refs":[["Josh",2,7,2,7],["Judg",12,5,12,5],["Judg",12,6,12,6]]},{"text":"Ferry boats often used on — 2Sa 19:18.","refs":[["2Sam",19,18,19,18]]},{"text":"Division of its waters to let Israel pass over. — Jos 3:12-16; 5:1.","refs":[["Josh",3,12,3,16],["Josh",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Return of its waters to their place. — Jos 4:18.","refs":[["Josh",4,18,4,18]]},{"text":"Slaughter of Moabites. — Jdj 3:28,29.","refs":[["Judg",3,28,3,28],["Judg",3,29,3,29]]},{"text":"Slaughter of the Ephraimites. — Jdj 12:4-6.","refs":[["Judg",12,4,12,6]]},{"text":"Its division by Elijah. — 2Ki 2:8.","refs":[["2Kgs",2,8,2,8]]},{"text":"Its division by Elisha. — 2Ki 2:14.","refs":[["2Kgs",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Healing of Naaman the leper. — 2Ki 5:10,14.","refs":[["2Kgs",5,10,5,10],["2Kgs",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"Baptism of multitudes by John the Baptist. — Mt 3:6; Mr 1:5; Joh 1:28.","refs":[["Matt",3,6,3,6],["Mark",1,5,1,5],["John",1,28,1,28]]},{"text":"Baptism of our Lord. — Mt 3:13,15; Mr 1:9.","refs":[["Matt",3,13,3,13],["Matt",3,15,3,15],["Mark",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Promised. — De 4:22; 9:1; 11:31.","refs":[["Deut",4,22,4,22],["Deut",9,1,9,1],["Deut",11,31,11,31]]},{"text":"In an appointed order. — Jos 3:1-8.","refs":[["Josh",3,1,3,8]]},{"text":"Preceded by priests with the ark. — Jos 3:6,11,14.","refs":[["Josh",3,6,3,6],["Josh",3,11,3,11],["Josh",3,14,3,14]]},{"text":"Successfully effected. — Jos 3:17; 4:1,10,11.","refs":[["Josh",3,17,3,17],["Josh",4,1,4,1],["Josh",4,10,4,10],["Josh",4,11,4,11]]},{"text":"Commemorated by a pillar of stones raised in it. — Jos 4:9.","refs":[["Josh",4,9,4,9]]},{"text":"Commemorated by a pillar of stones in Gilgal. — Jos 4:2-8,20-24.","refs":[["Josh",4,2,4,8],["Josh",4,20,4,24]]},{"text":"Alluded to. — Ps 74:15; 114:3,5.","refs":[["Ps",74,15,74,15],["Ps",114,3,114,3],["Ps",114,5,114,5]]},{"text":"A pledge that God would drive the Canaanites, & c out of their land. — Jos 3:10.","refs":[["Josh",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"The Jews had great pride in — Zec 11:3.","refs":[["Zech",11,3,11,3]]},{"text":"Despised by foreigners — 2Ki 5:12.","refs":[["2Kgs",5,12,5,12]]},{"text":"Moses not allowed to cross — De 3:27; 31:2.","refs":[["Deut",3,27,3,27],["Deut",31,2,31,2]]}],"refCount":55}
